refused: d144_label_value_in_another_unit.cy:16:28, line 16 column 28
16 |     draw(at.screen.pixels: 5 screen.points);
   |                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: this is `i32.screen.points`, and the label asks for `i32.screen.pixels`
 why:  a label's unit takes a plain number or that unit, and a value in another is refused (D144)
